---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us | McCuen Construction & Trucking | Billings, MT"
  description="McCuen Construction & Trucking is a family-owned trucking and construction company in Billings, Montana. Founded in 2021, we've grown from one truck to 11 axle setups."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-navy text-cream py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-brand uppercase tracking-widest text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Who We Are</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold">About McCuen Construction & Trucking</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Our Story</h2>
          <p class="text-steel-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">
            McCuen Construction & Trucking was founded in 2021 in Billings, Montana with a simple goal: provide dependable hauling and site work that people can count on. We started with a single side dump and a three-axle truck, taking on every job we could and making sure we did it right.
          </p>
          <p class="text-steel-dark leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Through word of mouth and a reputation for showing up on time and getting the work done, we've grown steadily. Today we run 11 axle setups and serve customers across Yellowstone County and beyond.
          </p>
          <p class="text-steel-dark leading-relaxed">
            We're still the same family-owned operation that started it all &mdash; the kind of company where you can call and talk to real people who actually care about your project.
          </p>
        </div>
        <!-- Photo placeholder -->
        <div class="bg-steel/10 rounded-lg aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center text-steel p-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-16 w-16 mx-auto mb-3 opacity-40" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-sm italic">Add photo: owner or team with trucks</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-cream-dark">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">What We Stand For</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Dependable</h3>
          <p class="text-steel-dark text-sm leading-relaxed">When we say we'll be there, we're there. Our reputation is built on following through on every commitment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Local</h3>
          <p class="text-steel-dark text-sm leading-relaxed">We live and work in Billings. This is our community, and we take pride in building it up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8 text-brand" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Hardworking</h3>
          <p class="text-steel-dark text-sm leading-relaxed">We didn't grow from one truck to eleven by cutting corners. We outwork the job and move on to the next one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Equipment -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4">Our Equipment</h2>
      <p class="text-steel-dark text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        We maintain a well-equipped fleet to handle jobs of all sizes. From side dumps to multi-axle setups, we've got the right rig for the job.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {['Side dump trucks', 'End dump trucks', 'Truck tractors', 'Multi-axle trailer setups', 'Excavation equipment', 'Grading equipment'].map((item) => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6 flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand/10 rounded flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-brand" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-medium">{item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Area -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-navy text-cream">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Service Area</h2>
      <p class="text-steel-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Based in Billings, Montana, we serve Yellowstone County and surrounding communities. As an interstate-certified carrier (MC #1282815), we also handle jobs across Montana and beyond state lines when your project requires it.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        {['Billings', 'Laurel', 'Lockwood', 'Shepherd', 'Huntley', 'Worden', 'Yellowstone County', 'Greater Montana'].map((area) => (
          <span class="bg-navy-light text-steel-light px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">{area}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Let's Work Together</h2>
      <p class="text-steel-dark text-lg mb-8">Got a project in mind? We'd love to hear about it.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand text-white px-8 py-4 rounded font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-light transition-colors">
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
